# A long clip on the instrumented player, sought ahead and played out (cavekit-flash.md R8, T-578): On2 VP6, 272 rows,
# 86.8 s. The picture and the sound are read while it plays from its start; a press on the movie's right band seeks to
# 40 s, the stream's time is at the target within the bound, and the clip plays to NetStream.Play.Stop at its length.
id: flash-video-vp6-272
section: Flash
item: An On2 VP6 video of 272 rows plays, is sought ahead and plays out: the time follows the seek, the stream ends at the clip's length, the picture is never blank
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-flash-instr.html?movie=avm2&vars=video=http://192.168.1.245:8097/video/harrypotter-vp6.flv%26seek=40
kit: cavekit-flash.md R8
wait text vmeta "codec=4" 30
wait text video "video t=" 10
wait content m 15
expect audio running 10
audio-watch
expect flash-rate m 10 7.1 40
expect flash-drawn m yes
sample before m
flash-tap m 400 300 showAll 330 260
wait text vctl "vctl seek 40" 5
wait differs m before 5
wait text video "video t=4" 4
expect number vtime 38 58
wait text vend "Play.Stop" 70
expect audio-watched running
expect number vendtime 84.3 87.3
expect plugin 3 alive
